config RUST_CRED
	bool "Rust credential source proposal (not admitted)"
	depends on RUST && BROKEN
	default n
	help
	  Inactive continuation of the existing credential Rust implementation.
	  Configured ABI/CFI, init and diagnostic metadata, native lifetimes and
	  original-test qualification remain open. Keep this disabled.
